{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/realfloridaadventures/items/329221/", "pk": 329221, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/realfloridaadventures/", "pk": 60827, "shortname": "realfloridaadventures", "name": "Real Florida Adventures", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Boggy Creek Airboat Ride Adventures & Transport", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 10, "unicode": "Boggy Creek Airboat Ride Adventures & Transport", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 72.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 12.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 35000, "description": "#Boggy Creek Airboat Adventure\n\n##Duration\n\nApprox. 3 Hours\n\n## About This Tour\n\nDiscover territory that remains unaltered in the wilderness of the Central Florida Everglades  with a thrilling airboat ride to start your day. View the amazing wildlife Florida has to offer as the wind blows through your hair while you travel up to 40mph.\n\nExperienced captains take you into the breathtaking beauty of nature, including wetlands and wildlife. See alligators, turtles, birds and more in their natural environment.\n\nAfter your trip, stroll through the Native American Village to learn about how they survived in this beautiful wetland. Towering Chickee’s cover genuine artifacts and hand-made creations of Native Americans. \n\nThink you can make it as a prospector? Before you leave make sure to try your luck at the gem mining experience. Kids will love it as they sift through sand looking for the perfect stone. \n\nThis is a perfect way to start your morning and be back in time to enjoy whatever you have planned for the rest of the day! \n\n**Included**\n•\t30 or 60 min Airboat Tour  \n•\tAlligator Oasis (Live gator viewing area)\n•\tHearing protection and life vests\n•\tGem Mine Experience (One per Party)\n•\tNative American Village  \n•\tRoundtrip Transportation from International Drive, Disney and Kissimmee areas\n•\tProfessional, Certified and Licensed Tour Guide\n\n**Not Included**\n•\tGratuities\n•\tDrinks\n•\tMeals\n\n\n##Pickup Time and Schedule\n\n**Margaritaville Resort Orlando** at 7:15am\n*8000 Fins Up Cir, Kissimmee, FL 34747*\n\n**Golden Corral** at 7:30am\n*8707 Vineland Ave, Orlando, FL 32821*\n \n**Orlando Star Flyer at Icon Park** at 8am \n*8265 International Dr, Orlando, FL 32819*", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "##Please arrive 15 minutes early\n\nWe look forward to seeing you soon!\n\n#Boggy Creek Airboat Adventures\n\n**Included**\n•\t30 or 60 min Airboart Tour  \n•\tAlligator Oasis (Live gator viewing area)\n•\tHearing protection and life vests\n•\tNative American Village  \n•\tRoundtrip Transportation from International Drive, Disney and Kissimmee areas\n•\tProfessional, Certified and Licensed Tour Guide\n\n**Not Included**\n•\tGratuities\n•\tDrinks\n•\tMeals\n\n#**Gratuities**\nYour tour guides gratuities are NOT included in the cost of your tour package.  Although, not compulsory, tipping is expected and is an expression of your satisfaction with the people who have assisted you throughout your tour.  Although it may not be customary to you, it is of considerable significance to the tour guide who will take care of you for the entire day.  As a guide for you, based upon the cost of the tour booked:\n**10% - $12 | 15% - $18 | 20% - $24  (suggested gratuities are per person)**\n\n##What to bring\nSunscreen, Sunglasses, Camera’s, Proof of Confirmation", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "All Ages • Approx. 3 Hours", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/realfloridaadventures/items/329221/images/632801/", "pk": 632801, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/W8IwAyfRCi5ulp1HiMuW", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/W8IwAyfRCi5ulp1HiMuW", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/realfloridaadventures/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/realfloridaadventures/items/329221/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/W8IwAyfRCi5ulp1HiMuW", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/W8IwAyfRCi5ulp1HiMuW", "is_low_resolution": false, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/realfloridaadventures/items/329221/images/632802/", "pk": 632802, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/rNrWpEMZT8ycD1PXVbDS", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/rNrWpEMZT8ycD1PXVbDS", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/realfloridaadventures/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/realfloridaadventures/items/329221/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/rNrWpEMZT8ycD1PXVbDS", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/rNrWpEMZT8ycD1PXVbDS", "is_low_resolution": false, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/realfloridaadventures/items/329221/images/632803/", "pk": 632803, "unicode": "photo", "galler